usar jmeter
comando para criar fila
>aws --endpoint-url=http://localhost:4566 sqs create-queue --queue-name driver-location-test-queue{
                            "QueueUrl": "http://sqs.us-east-1.localhost.localstack.cloud:4566/000000000000/driver-location-test-queue"
                        }

 consultar filas criadas aws --endpoint-url=http://localhost:4566 sqs list-queues

Consultar (receber) mensagens de uma fila (1 ou mais mensagens):
aws --endpoint-url=http://localhost:4566 sqs receive-message --queue-url http://sqs.us-east-1.localhost.localstack.cloud:4566/000000000000/driver-location-test-queue --max-number-of-messages 10


